---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import courtOfWands from '../assets/books/court-of-wands.png';
import collisionInMidair from '../assets/books/collision-in-midair.png';
import orElseTheyAreTrees from '../assets/books/or-else-they-are-trees.jpeg';
import whenWeLookAtThings from '../assets/books/when-we-look-at-things.png';
import highPriestess from '../assets/books/high-priestess.png';
---

<Base 
  title="Books - Mike Bagwell"
  description="Chapbooks and published collections by Mike Bagwell"
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="reveal mb-12">
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[var(--color-ink)]">
        Books
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xl text-[var(--color-mute)] max-w-2xl">
        Chapbooks and published collections.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-24">
      <section class="reveal grid md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto">
          <Image 
            src={courtOfWands} 
            alt="Poem of Thanks: A Court of Wands cover" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"
            widths={[360, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, 360px"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3">
            <em>Poem of Thanks: A Court of Wands</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-4">
            Metatron Press, 2025
          </p>
          <div class="prose prose-xl">
            <p>
              Composed over twelve years, with simultaneous journeys through the Chinese zodiac, Hieronymus Bosch's <em>The Garden of Earthly Delights</em>, and the poet's life, these poems are held together by constraints, linguistic play, and a fascination with structure as an enzyme of creativity.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://metatronpress.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Available from Metatron Press</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal grid md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto">
          <Image 
            src={collisionInMidair} 
            alt="A Collision of Soul in Midair cover" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"
            widths={[360, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, 360px"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3">
            <a href="https://bottlecap.press/products/collision" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">
              <em>A Collision of Soul in Midair</em>
            </a>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-4">
            Bottlecap Press, 2023
          </p>
          <div class="prose prose-xl">
            <p>
              A vibrant tour of many realms, a nimble flight through wild phantasmagoria, abundance, and the slippery mechanics of meaning. A delight in the overabundance of signs, a fascination with structure as an enzyme of creativity.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://bottlecap.press/products/collision" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Available from Bottlecap Press</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal grid md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto">
          <Image 
            src={orElseTheyAreTrees} 
            alt="Or Else They Are Trees cover" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"
            widths={[360, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, 360px"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3">
            <em>Or Else They Are Trees</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-4">
            El Aleph Press
          </p>
          <div class="prose prose-xl">
            <p>
              The first publication by El Aleph Press, a collaboration between Rebecca Miller and Michael Bagwell. The collection pairs artwork and poetry side by side in a gorgeous full-color layout.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal grid md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto">
          <Image 
            src={whenWeLookAtThings} 
            alt="When We Look at Things We Steal Their Color cover" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"
            widths={[360, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, 360px"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3">
            <em>When We Look at Things We Steal Their Color and Grow Heavy Under Their Weight</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-4">
            Rinky Dink Press, 2024
          </p>
          <div class="prose prose-xl">
            <p>
              A micro-chapbook.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://rinky-dink-press.square.site/product/series-11/50" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Available from Rinky Dink Press</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal grid md:grid-cols-[360px_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start">
        <div class="w-full max-w-[360px] mx-auto">
          <Image 
            src={highPriestess} 
            alt="Poem of Thanks: The High Priestess cover" 
            class="w-full h-auto rounded-sm shadow-[0_24px_50px_-30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.55)]"
            widths={[360, 720]}
            sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, 360px"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight mb-3">
            <em>Poem of Thanks: The High Priestess</em>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-4">
            Ghost City Press, 2024
          </p>
          <div class="prose prose-xl">
            <p>
              An excerpt from the book-length <em>Poem of Thanks</em>. Cover art by Rebecca Miller.
            </p>
            <p>
              <a href="https://ghostcitypress.com/2024-summer-series/poem-of-thanks-the-high-priestess" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Available for free from Ghost City Press</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
